    <string name="tune_rider_maybe_waived">%1$s. The rider requirement may be waived on this board, so the board may run Profile A whatever the pads say: this may not be the rider level it acts on.</string>
    <string name="tune_rider_waived">Rider not required on this board: Profile A always runs</string>
    <string name="tune_profile_a">A: rider present</string>
    <string name="tune_profile_b">B: no rider</string>
    <string name="tune_profile_slave_note">The slave\'s profiles follow the rider requirement read from its store, taken to be what it runs: the board does not report the value it booted with.</string>
    <string name="tune_stale_title">Not reachable: last-read values</string>
    <string name="tune_stale_body">These are the values last read from this board. Writes are off until it is read again.</string>
